# Production Environment Variables for MataBumi Frontend
# 
# IMPORTANT: This file is for local reference only.
# Set these variables in Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables

# For Vercel deployment with serverless backend:
# Use relative path so frontend calls backend on same domain
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Note: With Vercel serverless functions:
# - Frontend: https://matabumi.vercel.app
# - Backend API: https://matabumi.vercel.app/api/*
# - Both deployed together on Vercel
# - No separate backend URL needed!
